              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Flo thinks she did better on the written test than on the online test because 21 is greater than 3.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Explain why she is incorrect.",
              "marks": []
